  title="What is a Web Worker? A second thread, and the copy that decides if it is worth it"
  description="A Web Worker runs your script on a separate thread so heavy work stops blocking the interface. What it can and cannot reach, why postMessage copies rather than shares, how transferring an ArrayBuffer avoids that copy, and how it differs from a Service Worker."
  cat="apis"
